"Function": "Función",
"Gather the incident lead, the deputy and a few staff for {n} to {n} minutes. Read each event aloud, talk through the questions, and write down what was unclear. Nothing is touched on real systems.": "Reúna al responsable del incidente, al delegado y a algunas personas del personal durante {n} a {n} minutos. Lea cada evento en voz alta, comenten las preguntas y anoten lo que no quedó claro. No se toca nada en los sistemas reales.",
